Title: Are Hull City fans falling out of love with Acun Ilicali?
Date: 2025-07-14
Firsthand information: {'Speaker': [{'Speaker': 'Daniel Mawer', 'Text': '"It\'s such a tricky time, but it\'s not like we haven\'t seen it before," he says.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 7, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 64}}, {'Speaker': 'Daniel Mawer', 'Text': '"But usually it felt a bit more of a fun rollercoaster to be on over the past four years. This one feels more like we\'re on the steady decline of the rollercoaster.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 8, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 151}}, {'Speaker': 'Daniel Mawer', 'Text': '"If you look at where Acun was when he bought the club, where it was in terms of finance, maybe four or five personnel was all it needed to take it up to where it needed to be. Instead, there have been wholesale changes every window."', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 9, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 222}}, {'Speaker': 'Joe Collins', 'Text': '"He came in [and] he got the crowd\'s backing straight away with cheaper tickets," he says.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 21, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 78}}, {'Speaker': 'Joe Collins', 'Text': '"We had a disastrous season last season and the finances [are] in a really difficult spot.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 22, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 75}}, {'Speaker': 'Joe Collins', 'Text': '"You\'ve got some fans who are \'Acun out\', and there is definitely merit to that point of view.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 23, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 83}}, {'Speaker': 'Joe Collins', 'Text': '"There are some who believe in him because they\'ve had a sense of the feelgood factor and they sense that he cares, and then you\'ve got ones in the middle, waiting to see how it plays out."', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 24, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 164}}, {'Speaker': 'Charlotte Berry', 'Text': '"Being Hull City, nothing surprises me anymore," she says. "I feel like it\'s a blip in the road. Acun\'s got my full backing. It just looks like admin errors."', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 27, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 164}}, {'Speaker': 'Daniel Mawer', 'Text': 'Daniel also thinks the owner "does care" and "wants it to work".', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 28, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 65}}, {'Speaker': 'Joe Collins', 'Text': '"massively change the way we do things from now forward, because if this transfer restriction stays, we can\'t carry on spending as we were".', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 29, 'StartChar': 23, 'EndChar': 142}}], 'Description': [{'Description': "Last week, a club source told the BBC's Mike White that there were long-standing and growing concerns within the club about finances and the ability to keep up with day-to-day payments with suppliers.", 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 10, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 169}}, {'Description': 'In an open letter to fans, Ilicali addressed those concerns by conceding that the club experienced a cashflow issue when it did not receive a £1.5m payment for a player – money that had been earmarked for suppliers.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 11, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 181}}, {'Description': 'He promised to cover the shortfall and said "we have zero conflict with any clubs".', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 12, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 74}}], 'Image': [{'ID': 'image_1', 'Caption': 'A man with short dark hair and wearing a black T-shirt stands up from a crowd of people, waving with both hands in the air.'}]}
